References and credits
----------------------

Advocatra is an independent implementation. It contains no code copied from
any other project. Its architecture — native iOS, native Android, a
TypeScript web/cloud service, a portable encrypted local vault, and optional
Stripe-billed cloud synchronization — is consciously modeled on the public
design of Saldima (https://github.com/johnarleyburns/saldima and its iOS/
Android companion repositories), an unrelated accounting product by the same
author. No Saldima code is linked into or shipped with Advocatra.

Dependencies bundled with Advocatra must be MIT, BSD, Apache-2.0, ISC, 0BSD or
CC0; CI enforces this.
